---
title: Proposed Forge physics - one fixed tick
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant T as Tick scheduler
    participant P as Tile physics
    participant A as Animation
    participant S as Snapshot
    Note over T,S: Proposed fixed-tick sequence
    T->>T: InputApply - velocity targets and jump edge
    T->>P: Move - apply targets
    Note over P,A: Q16 integration advances velocity, then position.
    T->>P: Collide - resolve X then Y
    Note over P,A: Fast bodies sweep to first impact.
    P-->>T: Resolved root and contact facts
    T->>A: Animate from this tick
    A-->>T: Frame and local pose
    T->>T: Effects - deliver events
    T->>S: Publish completed tick
    Note over A,S: Publish Q8 y-up wire positions.<br/>Keep Q16 runtime state.
